00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:18,000
Alex Gibney explores the phenomenon of Stuxnet, a self-replicating
computer virus discovered in 2010 by international IT experts.

4
00:30:56,000 --> 00:31:02,000
Evidently commissioned by the US and Israeli governments, this malware was
designed to specifically sabotage Iran’s nuclear programme.

5
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:46,000
However, the complex computer worm ended up not only infecting its
intended target but also spreading uncontrollably.

